    <string name="start_page_private_store">Private Tabs in %1$s share cookies and site storage of their own, apart from the rest of the Profile. Sites you open here don\'t see its sign-ins.</string>
    <string name="start_page_private_traces">Pages you open here stay out of the history. Screenshots and the recent-apps preview are blocked.</string>
    <string name="start_page_private_end">When the last Private Tab closes, their cookies and site storage are erased. Private Tabs don\'t come back after the app is closed.</string>
    <string name="start_page_private_downloads">Files you download are saved to the device but left off the Profile\'s list of downloads.</string>
    <string name="start_page_first_run_title">Your Pinned Tabs and recent pages will show here</string>
    <string name="start_page_first_run_pin">To pin a page, hold its Tab in the Tab list and choose \"Pin Tab\". Bookmarking a page from the page menu pins its Tab too.</string>
    <string name="start_page_first_run_profiles">%1$s is a Profile. Its sign-ins, history and bookmarks stay inside it. To use a second account on the same sites, tap the avatar and add another Profile.</string>
